Package: canctl
Version: 1.0
Section: custom
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-can
Maintainer: Ólafur Steinn Jónsson <olafursj23@ru,is>
Description: A CLI tool for CANopen motor controller testing.
 This package provides a simple command-line interface to send 
 NMT commands, SDO writes, and PDO velocity commands over SocketCAN.